  "Scenes.Mountain.MinotaurRouter.WalksOn": "Minding your own business, you walk along the winding paths. You take your time to enjoy the view until you see a shadow approaching you. You turn around to see a minotaur! However, he is much bigger than the other minotaurs you've seen. You estimate him to be eleven feet tall and he's wielding a chain-whip. He's intent on raping you!"
